Terror Run is the aptly-named area in the Southwestern quadrant of [[Un'goro Crater]]. The area is infested with giant dinosaurs of every type including [[Devilsaur]], [[Pterrordax]], [[Diemetradon]] and [[Stegodon]], some of which are [[elite]].

